    "text": "By WBRZ Staff ,\n7 hours ago BATON ROUGE — A man accused of shooting a person in the stomach was arrested for attempted murder by Baton Rouge Police officers on Thursday. The shooting happened along Live Oak Boulevard on Aug. 21. When offices arrived, they found a man who had been shot in the stomach, and he was taken to a hospital. Read full article",
